For each of these languages: 

ar, da, de, en, es, fr, he, it, ja, nl, pl, pt, pt-br, ru, tr, zh

------

For the ones asked to javascript, write as "window.translations = {[...languages]: {....[keys]:[translated sentences]}}", resulting in window.translations[language][key] = translated sentence;

For the ones asked to PHP, write as "[/* main key name */] => [[...languages] => [...keys] => [translated sentences]]", resulting in $translations['main_key_name'][language][key] = translated sentence;

